# Modern.js App

## Setup

Install the dependencies:

```bash
pnpm install
```

{{#unless isSubproject}}The `prepare` script installs a pre-commit hook with Rstack CLI. Each commit checks and formats staged files with `rs staged`.

For a new Git repository, run `git init` before installing dependencies. If you initialize Git later, run `pnpm prepare` to install the hook.

{{/unless}}## Get Started

Start the development server:

```bash
pnpm dev
```

Build the app for production:

```bash
pnpm build
```

Preview the production build locally:

```bash
pnpm serve
```

For more information, see the [Modern.js documentation](https://modernjs.dev/en).
